tsunaida sono te tsuyoku nigitta

00:49:49.080 --> 00:49:55.440
That's why I held your hand

00:49:55.440 --> 00:50:01.590
hon no sukoshi mae made shiranakatta kimi ga

00:49:55.440 --> 00:50:01.590
I only came to know you recently,

00:50:01.590 --> 00:50:10.100
ima konna ni mo kakegae nai hitori natteku

00:50:01.590 --> 00:50:10.100
and you're already irreplaceable to me

00:50:10.100 --> 00:50:16.390
wasurenaide ne itsumo soba ni iru yo

00:50:10.100 --> 00:50:16.390
Don't forget, I'm right here

