yorokobi mo kanashimi mo wakeaitai kara

00:50:16.390 --> 00:50:22.710
I want to share everything with you

00:50:22.710 --> 00:50:29.980
kimi no tonari ni zutto irareta nara

00:50:22.710 --> 00:50:29.980
If we manage to remain together,

00:50:29.980 --> 00:50:38.210
donna koto demo norikoerareru yo kitto

00:50:29.980 --> 00:50:38.210
then I'm sure nothing will stop us

